\n```\r\n\r\nHow would you recommend me approaching this?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468627999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468745815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98383#issuecomment-2468745815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98383","id":2468745815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TJhJX","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T18:00:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T18:00:31Z","body":"[PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_@globalscope.html#enum-globalscope-propertyhint)'s hint string supports suffixing `:` followed by an integer to denote a specific value. If not specified it increments the value by 1 for the next option.\r\n\r\n`\"Single-Safe:1,Multi-Threaded\"`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions"